    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BROE auctioneers are delighted to present this two-bedroom mid terrace property to the market with the benefit of a private South West facing rear garden and is not overlooked to the front. Number 107 is brought to the market with well-appointed accommodation and spacious room proportions. The bright and spacious accommodation briefly comprises of entrance hallway, living room, kitchen / dining room, 2 spacious bedrooms and main family bathroom. To the rear is a large private South West facing garden c. (7m x 4m) and to the front is a cobble lock driveway for off-street parking. Nestled in an established area, No. 107 is a perfect location for families or first-time buyers alike. Ideally located close to a host of local amenities to include shops, schools, Clondalkin Village, the M50, N7 and the Luas is only minutes away.\r\n\r\nContact Craig Leap of BROE auctioneers to register your interest."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHallway\t     \t\t         1.42m x 1.21m \t\tLaminated wood flooring. \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving room\t\t\t4.17m x 3.09m \t\tFeature fireplace with wood burning stove, laminated wood flooring, ample storage. \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining Room \t4.40m x 2.76m\t\tGreat range of floor and eye level units to include 5 ring gas hob and most appliances, recess lighting, ceramic tile flooring, door to rear garden. \r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom (1)\t\t\t3.63m x 3.24m \t\tBuilt in wardrobes.\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom (2)\t\t\t3.11m x 2.49m\t\tBuilt in wardrobes.\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t\t2.03m x 1.83m\t\tFully tiled bathroom to include W.C, WHB & bath with Triton electric shower, heated towel \tradiator.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note any information, statement, description, quantity, or measurement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuations or hand out issued by or on behalf of BROE auctioneers are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any mistake, omission, inaccuracy or mis description given orally or contained in any sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuation or hand out issues by BROE auctioneers. Agents shall not give rise to any right of action, claim, entitlement, or compensation against BROE auctioneers. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by carrying out their own independent due diligence, inspections or otherwise as to the correctness of any and all the information, statements, descriptions, quantity or measurements contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuation or hand out issued by BROE auctioneers. The services, systems and appliances shown have not been tested and no warranty is made or given by BROE auctioneers as to their operability or efficiency."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tGas fired central heating.\r\n•\tDouble glazed windows to rear.\r\n•\tSouth West facing private rear garden.\r\n•\tExcellent location.\r\n•\tIn walking distance to Clondalkin Village and Corkagh Park. \r\n•\tAmple Parking.\r\n•\tEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
